  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Menta Venkata Setty vs The State Of Ap on 30 July, 2019 Honourable Sri Justice D.V.S.S. Somayajulu Criminal Petition No.4502 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioner under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure to quash the proceedings against him, in FIR No.122 of 2019, on the file of Podalakur Police Station, Sri Potti Sriramulu Nellore District. The offences alleged are under Section 272, 273, 328 of IPC and Section 59 (I) of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "Heard Sri Raja Reddy Koneti, learned counsel for the petitioner and the learned Public Prosecutor appearing for the respondent-State. Both the counsels agree that this matter is squarely covered by the judgment of the single Judge in the batch petitions bearing Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018 and others.",
